# Exam track — Theme: Vacation & Travel — Sub-lesson 2: Key Phrases
# Plain sentences (no @question): presented in either direction.
# Mixed with the vocabulary these phrases lean on, so sessions alternate
# word-match and sentence-builder slots.

@lesson V1.02 "Vacation Phrases"

@word d'Fräizäit = free time
@word de Congé = time off
@word d'Auslandsrees = trip abroad
@word iwwernuechten = to stay overnight
@word packen = to pack
@word plangen = to plan
@word ukommen = to arrive
@word zeréckkommen = to come back
@word bleiwen = to stay
@word d'Souvenir = souvenir
@word wäit = far
@word no = near

@sentence
@lu Ech fuere gär un d'Mier.
@en I like going to the sea.
@distractor-lu Bierg
@distractor-lu schafft
@distractor-en mountain
@distractor-en works

@sentence
@lu Mir hunn en Hotel op der Plage gebucht.
@en We booked a hotel on the beach.
@distractor-lu geflunn
@distractor-lu Zuch
@distractor-en flew
@distractor-en train

@sentence
@lu D'lescht Joer si mir a Spuenien geflunn.
@en Last year we flew to Spain.
@distractor-lu gefuer
@distractor-lu nächst
@distractor-en drove
@distractor-en next

@sentence
@lu Ech maache gär Fotoen an der Vakanz.
@en I like taking photos on vacation.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu Valise
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en suitcase

@sentence
@lu Den Zuch ass méi séier wéi de Bus.
@en The train is faster than the bus.
@distractor-lu manner
@distractor-lu lues
@distractor-en slower
@distractor-en plane

@sentence
@lu Mir bleiwen eng Woch am Hotel.
@en We are staying one week at the hotel.
@distractor-lu ginn
@distractor-lu Dag
@distractor-en leaving
@distractor-en day

@sentence
@lu D'Vakanz war immens schéin.
@en The vacation was really beautiful.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu wäert
@distractor-en will
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@lu Ech hu meng Valise scho gepaakt.
@en I have already packed my suitcase.
@distractor-lu kaaft
@distractor-lu däin
@distractor-en bought
@distractor-en your

@sentence
@lu Mir kommen e Sonndeg zeréck.
@en We are coming back on Sunday.
@distractor-lu fueren
@distractor-lu Méindeg
@distractor-en leaving
@distractor-en Monday

@sentence
@lu Ech hunn dräi Wochen Congé am Summer.
@en I have three weeks off in summer.
@distractor-lu zwou
@distractor-lu Wanter
@distractor-en two
@distractor-en winter

@sentence
@lu D'Bierger si vun hei net wäit.
@en The mountains are not far from here.
@distractor-lu Plage
